    "title": "Grand opening of Outside The Box Marketplace set for July 14 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "VICKSBURG, Miss. (KTVE/KARD) — Vicksburg officials are inviting the public to the grand opening of Outside The Box Marketplace at 10 a.m. on Monday, July 14, 2025. Courtesy photo Outside The Box Marketplace is Vicksburg’s newest local hub. It will feature grab-and-go meals, gifts, Vicksburg-themed treasures, and more. In addition, inside the Marketplace, Nutri Lifestyle will serve healthy meals for healthier lifestyle options. Outside The Box Marketplace’s regular hours will be Monday to Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KTVE - myarklamiss.com.",
